==Other Appearances==
==={{Animal Crossing: New Horizons|-}}===
{{Noncanon|Start}}
In {{Animal Crossing: New Horizons}}'s {{Np|Animal Crossing: New Horizons/Update history/3.0|Version 3.0}} update, Silent Princesses appear as {{Np|Furniture}}. The {{Np|Player}} can find Silent Princesses in both [[Mineru#Animal Crossing: New Horizons|Mineru]]'s and [[Tulin#Animal Crossing: New Horizons|Tulin]]'s {{Np|House|Houses}}. Silent Princesses can be purchased from {{Np|Nook Shopping}} for 700 {{Np|Bell|Bells}} after scanning any compatible [[amiibo]] from {{TLoZ Series}}.
