==Trivia==
* In {{BotW}} and {{TotK}}, three Silent Princesses grow near the [[Pedestal of the Master Sword]] in [[Korok Forest]]. The locations of these Flowers, with two on the left and one on the right, are the same locations of the unidentified Flowers in {{ALttP}} that grow near the Pedestal in the [[Lost Woods]].
* In the Japanese version of {{BotW|-}}, instead of saying that Silent Princesses can only thrive in the wild, Zelda muses that perhaps its extinction is inevitable.<ref name="BotW Zelda 3"/>
* In {{TotK|-}}, Silent Princesses and [[Sundelion]]s are near-perfect color inversions of each other, and they both feature five-petal shapes.<ref name="Reddit"/>

